 "description": "\"Geocode [address] via Google Maps\" / \"Google Maps coordinates of [place]\" / \"lat lng for [address] using Google\" \u2014 convert an address to lat/lng + formatted address via Google Maps Platform. Premium-quality geocoding (highest accuracy for US addresses); requires Google Maps API key. Use when Mapbox/MapTiler/OpenStreetMap miss the address.",
 "inputSchema": {
